    "body": "This is a follow-up to bitcoin/bitcoin#35221. The `MakeAndPushFeature` member function template has no callers yet, which [triggers](https://my.cdash.org/builds/3851810/build) `-Wunused-template` now that Clang 23 [enables](https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/208001) it as part of `-Wall`.\r\n\r\nRelated PRs:\r\n - https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35679\r\n - https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35737\r\n - https://github.com/bitcoin-core/minisketch/pull/102",
